## Task lifecycle

Planned → scoped → in-progress → handoff → validated → complete. Do not mark integration work complete without idempotency, retry behavior, and sync direction considered.

## Conflict avoidance

One owner per writable area per task. Avoid editing the same file from multiple “roles” in one pass. Frontend must not run ahead of unstable APIs.

## Integration gate (QuickBooks / Google Sheets)

Before implementing sync or export features, ensure: idempotency, retries, external IDs, sync direction, and source of truth are defined. If not, clarify or implement them first.
